msgid "Pozyx for Non-GPS Navigation"
msgstr "Pozyx 无 GPS 导航"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:9 0dd0612c5a3f4ce8b88f4b5b97852194
#: 4a8abb4dcfda420fb7f789e7eb39ea40 6622ba43557e4ca9acc658b89effe755
#: 74e6b2ee4a2d45b0863658533c95a82d a2a750d7edb24762afdc52ca307651b7
msgid ""
"This article explains how a `Pozyx <https://www.pozyx.io/>`__ system based "
"on the `DWM1000 <http://www.decawave.com/products/dwm1000-module>`__ can be "
"used as a short-range substitute for a GPS allowing position control modes "
"like Loiter, PosHold, RTL, Auto indoors."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何将基于 `DWM1000 <http://www.decawave.com/products/dwm1000-module>`__ 的 "
"`Pozyx <https://www.pozyx.io/>`__ 系统用作 GPS 的短距替代方案，从而在室内实现 "
"Loiter、PosHold、RTL、Auto 等位置控制模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:15 2bfb0e6438fe41a39c3b32a3bbe55fe0
