#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:25 e911027a47cf4d879e125a43d31a5c9f
msgid ""
"The anchors should be placed in a rectangular shape.  The anchor with the "
"lowest ID (IDs are printed in hexidecimal on each device) will act as the "
"\"origin\" and should be placed at the lower-left corner of the rectangle.  "
"Each of the remaining three anchors should be placed in a corner so that the"
" anchor IDs increase as you travel an \"N\" pattern within the rectangle.  "
"The configuration is slightly simpler if the line from the origin anchor to "
"the 2nd anchor is due North but it is not required as the "
":ref:`BCN_ORIENT_YAW <BCN_ORIENT_YAW>` parameter can be used to account this"
" difference."
msgstr ""
"锚节点应呈矩形排列。ID 最低的锚节点（ID 以十六进制打印在每个设备上）将作为「原点」，应放置在矩形的左下角。其余三个锚节点应分别放置在各角，使锚节点"
" ID 在矩形内按「N」形路径递增。若从原点锚节点到第二个锚节点的连线正好指向正北，配置会略微简单，但这不是必须的，因为可以使用 "
":ref:`BCN_ORIENT_YAW <BCN_ORIENT_YAW>` 参数来补偿偏差。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:31 16168636382242cdae0fda1283ed2ac0
#: 284eb4a237a541bb827e767a24f22ac2 294189c311a746659f62a3c6426436ca
#: e5ecc056ea404a45a78d506aa592d47c fd274d30b5384e57a6ead4ea8f20002f
msgid "Preparing the tag"
msgstr "准备标签"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:36 0937e9e92d994c98b0c2c5c99d0bb5a9
#: 1f00401bd79e4d4cb62ceaacae245de6 5692edc611c94a82adc563b0cbb96e69
#: 5a8df1ccfa5042989f6b49ac854cdb9a 84933466002e460e89acf9ede20cabc9
msgid ""
"connect one of the autopilot's telemetry connections to the UNO.  Telem1 is "
"shown above but any SERIAL port will work equally well."
msgstr "将飞控的一个数传端口连接到 UNO。上图显示的是 Telem1，但任意 SERIAL 端口均可。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:37 4b53d36b164d4344b8466974b58fa094
#: 687f5f8d8ebc4d3c8863854d925192b9 b46b912812ff44d0a22a372a89d040c1
#: d05ca9b2682a473c854870b441d613c3 daa90b7069954235acf6baddf2f59510
msgid ""
"autopilot's UART port GND should be connected to one of the UNO's GND pins."
msgstr "飞控的 UART 端口 GND 应连接到 UNO 的某个 GND 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:38 72540f83e5784e71898454b45e903ea8
#: bf4f5026e157477cbb6c8cdcfed44db8 c6114094fbd7417098643731fcfa5fe7
#: d8822dd0e9574d83a0219d51da24e335 dbbf860c50bf4ccda46f144b429e7cdd
msgid "autopilot's UART port TX should be connected to the UNO's pin 10."
msgstr "飞控的 UART 端口 TX 应连接到 UNO 的第 10 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:39 1ed5b0346b944ee6b1ca7f61f989d5a6
#: 91c27043cc274cc5a113b27d7c928e70 9bc1fd4ef4f844a1b74bfc85301a00d5
#: c1c82509de6b48a5be34a9a7c55da2e1 c887670d24174dc59624df9addefc3f7
msgid "autopilot's UART port RX should be connected to the UNO's pin 11."
msgstr "飞控的 UART 端口 RX 应连接到 UNO 的第 11 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:40 4e86573b6f084f4d8eeae22a52c6b479
#: 524657a8e1eb48d488805ddc2ff13406 77b2c775815746348d109dd168dcca1c
#: 84f85cf171084b9dbde1057fec96242b dd32e20a91b6471caa2ffa51ea123858
msgid ""
"autopilot's UART port VCC may be connected to the UNO's 5V connector to "
"provide power to the Uno/Pozyx from the autopilot."
msgstr "飞控的 UART 端口 VCC 可连接到 UNO 的 5V 接口，从飞控为 Uno/Pozyx 供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:42 2ed8887f7a8a4ebb96a146964ee01340
#: 713d61844c5e4d80bb374f7d0cbb99cc d3a439c452544e10b8379dbcc7e8e29a
#: d9f385287e22477db607b32468dcd6de f3b1a4c5ce3d4fdeb9b36b98dabae041
msgid ""
"The Arduino IDE should be used to load `IndoorLoiter sketch "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Pozyx/IndoorLoiter/IndoorLoiter.ino>`__"
" onto the Uno after first changing the anchor tags `found here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Pozyx/IndoorLoiter/IndoorLoiter.ino#L12>`__"
" to match the IDs of the tags in your setup."
msgstr ""
"应使用 Arduino IDE 将 `IndoorLoiter 程序 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Pozyx/IndoorLoiter/IndoorLoiter.ino>`__"
" 上传到 Uno，上传前需先将 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Pozyx/IndoorLoiter/IndoorLoiter.ino#L12>`__"
" 的锚节点标签修改为与您设置中的标签 ID 一致。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:44 11099a6e3e2542b689c5cde9ff1b3210
#: 54cf4909e2d04277836adac9b2247c1a 875dcc4584d54a8591ce090960ac423e
#: b7a0e422f3ad4806990d33874a7c85f2 f55d1a161a68409b94577445d30887bf
msgid ""
"At this point you may wish to test the tag's ability to communicate with the"
" tags by:"
msgstr "此时您可以测试标签与锚节点的通信能力，方法如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:46 179a5b6e84924ad7bfc2d55b728c0664
#: 879eddd9fef54f9882b939c5b9aa6dda acc8681b6ca343278dbe417c46dc748d
#: b84e98b0a6e844739cd7c0464fbfac8d bf601587f99f4161a2a09c258e42f476
msgid "powering on all the anchors."
msgstr "为所有锚节点上电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:47 15eea094eced4f1c8fb4ba4b197cb8e4
#: 175e958e6575458fb8db0e740f002c7d 3fab8d40800a4f8196e469b87de45bdd
#: 47798b2c7bcb4a908eb3ec86b899ad05 840f1aaad3c4436ab5ae2f7675efc364
msgid "connect the UNO's Type B USB to your PC."
msgstr "将 UNO 的 Type B USB 连接到您的电脑。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:48 08c4941e4c63479d8e2b181f9ed589b6
#: 6a7b46160f064962981acbb783f459db 76ab084aa8544b49aea4fac78027ea1c
#: 8495b54705da430aac967173e6eb88db dfa1045a48054be0a1727915f6352694
msgid ""
"connect with the Arduino IDE's serial monitor (set to baud 115200) and check"
" no \"Beacon Configuration failed\" messages appear.  If they do, check that"
" the IDs have been set correctly in the IndoorLoiter2.ino sketch (above)."
msgstr ""
"使用 Arduino IDE 的串行监视器连接（波特率设为 115200），检查是否出现「Beacon Configuration "
"failed」消息。若有，请检查 IndoorLoiter2.ino 程序（见上文）中的 ID 是否已正确设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:50 06ef310cfc2d43d5ac77cd1477a99737
#: 1ba32fb4f7c8471a9afb2b57d9d4853a 4255f161deda4f6f86c93f6ae9acff70
#: 806dc62f51d440a7bab4d55085b22fe0 de48c737e65548be9bdacd6b27affc5f
msgid ""
"Mount the Pozyx tag on the top of the Arduino Uno and then mount on the "
"vehicle."
msgstr "将 Pozyx 标签安装在 Arduino Uno 顶部，然后安装到飞行器上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:53 31bec0bb46b449149a359b8fb0e99eac
#: 6fcbf60c154d4141ba24449b5ed400a3 923ee1fbda5e49d882457b45dd46d0e9
#: 9cea6465372642d49466dd9dec90fc95 fd014b55d6ba4ed892935926f43f5b7c
msgid "Configuration through the Ground Station"
msgstr "通过地面站配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:55 020ac01783e14377b9027c26b3a7d646
#: 0e240c3edd104267a90c4b4077b8c77d 16e0be4bc76d42da8bcdd27f2fcf9e20
#: 2585b8af6dbb4657810879bf75004204 cbbd6c1df74d4f6ea18919b031b22316
msgid "Connect with a Ground Station and set the following parameters:"
msgstr "连接地面站并设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:57 1b151c20628d4e88aa3ec4182c0b37b5
#: 51135e13b08448eba3c3a5b24e956dd8 65d5d10d18eb4d6c9c4278bd49c265fa
#: 7a0a146375a14e37994a1bb04185d186 a49a032e763a4f98bfc9606501c7b98b
msgid "set :ref:`BCN_TYPE <BCN_TYPE>` to 1 (means using Pozyx system)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`BCN_TYPE <BCN_TYPE>` 设为 1（表示使用 Pozyx 系统）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:58 173875c8cc28436ca6a8d53fda6ed4b4
#: 5468b4533e544d0c9ac6fe8749759fca 588bdf28e5de41cca95876ad14e57816
#: 76445ffa25814460a0b1e2f5fa7e1000 7a7b330a0d7e43a7842eba3bffbfb51f
msgid ""
"set :ref:`BCN_LATITUDE <BCN_LATITUDE>`, :ref:`BCN_LONGITUDE <BCN_LONGITUDE>`"
" and :ref:`BCN_ALT <BCN_ALT>` to match your actual location.  Getting these "
"values exactly correct is not particularly important although getting it "
"close is required in order for the compass's declination to be correctly "
"looked up from the small database held within ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`BCN_LATITUDE <BCN_LATITUDE>`、:ref:`BCN_LONGITUDE <BCN_LONGITUDE>` 和 "
":ref:`BCN_ALT <BCN_ALT>` 设为您的实际位置。精确匹配并非特别重要，但应大致接近，以便罗盘磁偏角能从 ArduPilot "
"内置的小型数据库中正确查询。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:59 0336610d21674e95affb19b51ae84d5e
#: 27d4d643ba9d4e80972634d4d372c09e 70ff3143573f45a580bf4f1e64adb395
#: aaa4fad59f1649c59c7c47ffa5e58a89 bae21f59802c4560b7a9428499aec90b
msgid ""
"set :ref:`BCN_ORIENT_YAW <BCN_ORIENT_YAW>` to the heading from the origin "
"anchor to the 2nd anchor.  One way to capture this value is to stand at the "
"origin holding the vehicle so that its nose points towards the second "
"beacon.  Read the vehicle's heading from the HUD and enter this value into "
":ref:`BCN_ORIENT_YAW <BCN_ORIENT_YAW>`"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`BCN_ORIENT_YAW <BCN_ORIENT_YAW>` "
"设为从原点锚节点指向第二个锚节点的航向角。获取此值的一种方法是站在原点处，手持飞行器使机头朝向第二个信标，然后从 HUD 读取飞行器航向并填入 "
":ref:`BCN_ORIENT_YAW <BCN_ORIENT_YAW>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:60 57d1ccd82a9a4af9ba31eb75eeda755c
#: 5d401a0c53644e3cbfcd1529be7815c3 bd8d3a6d17e14ab1936b004d54610c15
#: bf4eb90242e54defa499fc427613bb30 e76142dd24654dbf903132f229c1510a
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` to 4 (Beacon)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` 设为 4（Beacon）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:61 055e7824636c4a92b98d11424e17a144
#: 746de4ee50f94042b58e67c78a7dee05 75c03c3bf0af4dbd863731a98e90b440
#: cc8d9701946f4fc1a361a8b35a937eab ce03865c68b74327b6463f643384072d
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` to 0 (None)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` 设为 0（None）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:62 3b9d7e02cc404827bb629b64b83fc098
#: 7500ed91124445709c8f27ec2d61e56d abe6a6d9c6544915b173d49046944075
#: d76d0003e8f64427b327441aabf9e753 ec51c0744074467d82812364fb82cd86
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` to 0 (None)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` 设为 0（None）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:63 3914e395b63f4b9988741d682940f4d6
#: 6350399a28b9481cba04fe71e2f7a52c 729ebf215dbc4bab9d5761e6025dde76
#: 8f27567e71ef4a95933204029369c712 a8ec674c26ef476ca052647758b7d428
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ<EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` to  4 (Beacon)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ<EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` 设为 4（Beacon）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:64 5fb4e3d8585143b3a332e7f2f1301442
#: 72ddca2d1615457bbe16baadaa26b83d af9f48eab26940c5847fdce35cd8f3c3
#: e45446bf538a42348d4c9ee910d84690 eaee2ab497de4fdab415150d53e36038
msgid ""
"set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW<EK3_SRC1_YAW>` to 1 (Compass) since a compass is "
"required for use with this device."
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW<EK3_SRC1_YAW>` 设为 1（Compass），因为使用此设备需要罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:65 4787d602f11f47d59acce92c345ebe2a
msgid ""
"set :ref:`ARMING_CHECK <ARMING_CHECK>` to -9 to disable the GPS arming check"
msgstr "将 :ref:`ARMING_CHECK <ARMING_CHECK>` 设置为 -9 以禁用 GPS 解锁检查"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:66 89566ab81c51431481bf51f40f6e8b71
#: c5276bc94a6741709f5ddf4bbf063d49 cfc0b11e4e1f43008b760612adcf87d9
#: fc35d8be4a8c461cbed90557932009c0 fe862112b68e44619ce4b7e59b6c8ea0
msgid ""
"set :ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` to 115 to set SERIAL1 port's baud "
"rate to 115200 (if using a different SERIAL port set its baud rate to 115, "
"instead)"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` 设为 115，以将 SERIAL1 端口波特率设为 115200（如使用其他 "
"SERIAL 端口，请将该端口波特率同样设为 115）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:67 0b9350ea51714bb98da3321d451bde4e
#: 260c0794800d42579e5f9f3ba393b673 3f20035d5d0949028ff3c2c1c3bd6557
#: 8c29876f851c425280cd7478e5bca52f fb1eb3205743485d8878bf48e2ba88f8
msgid ""
"set :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` to 13 (Beacon) to enable "
"reading the IndoorLoiter2 protocol (If using a different port, set its "
"protocol to 13 instead)"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 设为 13（Beacon），以启用读取 "
"IndoorLoiter2 协议（如使用其他端口，请将该端口协议设为 13）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:68 0545c44732c243ec8bb3d036760fb14c
#: 2a7da88ebbd94fdca90a40f7637604f6 73bf4924be58447ab0ab8cda70af755f
#: abd0d04e4b034cdda1882b2acdaf6497 cee5326cee2e471690e1c4ffafa5bd3a
msgid ""
"set :ref:`BRD_SER1_RTSCTS <BRD_SER1_RTSCTS>` to 0 to ensure telem1 does not "
"use flow control (If using Telem2 set :ref:`BRD_SER2_RTSCTS "
"<BRD_SER2_RTSCTS>` instead, not required if using a SERIAL port without flow"
" control)"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`BRD_SER1_RTSCTS <BRD_SER1_RTSCTS>` 设为 0，确保 telem1 不使用流控（如使用 "
"Telem2，请设置 :ref:`BRD_SER2_RTSCTS <BRD_SER2_RTSCTS>`；如使用无流控的 SERIAL 端口则无需设置）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:71 227f3262f57f44dabe76e50dff988666
#: 47a2dce3688c4a3281974eeee0b52d9e 7fab7a5946414a868e0dab5f9ea8455f
#: 8e146516a0054d1f8b29635200b0a7bd d7aef95731274cbcb9a5e75784da8f2b
msgid "Ground Testing"
msgstr "地面测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:73 09d2155be0864d349c97186a83bfea74
#: 4c40125e15bd4882a901d57f0a559709 75972c4a8b484b498a05613a240a8760
#: 7934f1faa0a448ff96f1176167fee20c b5dc00e5c8e4469799894b189e15b507
msgid ""
"Connect the Autopilot to a ground station.  You may need to connect the Lipo"
" battery as well because some computers are unable to provide enough power "
"through their USB port for the combined autopilot+Pozyx+Uno."
msgstr "将飞控连接到地面站。您可能还需要连接 LiPo 电池，因为某些电脑无法通过 USB 端口为飞控+Pozyx+Uno 的组合提供足够电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:74 72bf513052e9419e8f1731eebd23d3d3
#: 8b0354977c9143a185d7be87c43b0ef7 a057bb44093f4da7bcec45dba8965182
#: a7bef67ce3144d7fbb417c40c7431347 f4262185e5ab4de5bcec3c09ffb4dd5b
msgid ""
"Press the UNO's white or red reset button which can be found next to the USB"
" port (see image above)"
msgstr "按下 UNO 的白色或红色复位按钮，该按钮位于 USB 端口旁边（见上图）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:75 bb73d0fa5b224f73a27f78142840e4ae
msgid ""
"After about 1 minute the vehicle's position should jump to the lattitude, "
"longitude you input during the configuration step (above).  If it does not, "
"connect a USB cable to the UNO's USB port and open the Arduino IDE's serial "
"monitor and look for errors."
msgstr ""
"约 1 分钟后，飞行器位置应跳转到您在配置步骤中输入的纬度和经度。若未跳转，请将 USB 线连接到 UNO 的 USB 端口，打开 Arduino "
"IDE 的串行监视器查找错误信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:76 2342d0b0dba24acbac1a8ec88f9df446
#: 56259e49a49b49679509dae76d8dbe2e 83e3f89587ca4726964c587f8df07237
#: a274821a1a4449b3a3714f5600b9d02c d1bce20ae7884b7e92a0bf9720049c8c
msgid ""
"Check that the vehicle's position is relatively stable (i.e. moving around "
"less than one meter)"
msgstr "检查飞行器位置是否相对稳定（即移动范围小于 1 米）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:77 4a60d858db2147a3b01430211416778f
#: 4b31f3dba6664026a68067f7b1b5390b 60757cefb6544edb960f90e916095bbd
#: 7730b52381d24e3e925ed26ebaf5bc24 c64bb29ec56e4e0da7fe3ec98a8cb22b
msgid ""
"Walk the vehicle around between the anchors and ensure that its position on "
"the map updates correctly"
msgstr "在锚节点之间移动飞行器，确认地图上的位置能正确更新"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:80 219500c482bf4ebdbaaf4d9b6bea499a
#: 3cf021eec90747f2b671d57a51c5fab3 97419ce21cb84204827ddc610eb5622c
#: dfb3c922e9594c248725dc8dd3943ce4 ed155e03da8c4fbf9752455acbfb8c77
msgid "Flight testing"
msgstr "飞行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:82 30a25678a50940abb2c851a15df27e40
#: a86ab3d21df9416080bbcd91d37271be a9c398e0c8bf4fe8bd948b0c987acf4d
#: d3eea5c713e042b0ab239f29186d7233 e06f06cee1b34775b1c053edb2c7e237
msgid ""
"Setup the transmitter with Stabilize, AltHold and Loiter flight modes. Take "
"off in AltHold mode and maintain a stable hover. Switch to Loiter but be "
"ready to switch back to AltHold or Stabilize if the vehicle's position or "
"altitude becomes unstable."
msgstr ""
"在遥控器上设置 Stabilize、AltHold 和 Loiter 飞行模式。在 AltHold 模式下起飞，保持稳定悬停。切换到 "
"Loiter，但如果飞行器位置或高度变得不稳定，请随时切换回 AltHold 或 Stabilize。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:87 291fd635ec2946899d7a577c1855a6ca
#: 30f34f5a3a11445a98109a6452442854 5fd89a95698346679a6e4429bdf73188
#: 62d9471fec1249d9b31ee2e72e52692c 81e228742b8243ee85e3d789c18e1a68
msgid "DataFlash logging"
msgstr "DataFlash 日志"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:89 3ad6ddffdc524e678dd451fd34a6cac9
#: 6f018e561406499e83b21ee914b15e13 88743d7cf80a4f9395db6028f1f97f33
#: dd499dfe08f04812ab7736a052866550 df088c9395174f05aabf8ec76955fb03
msgid ""
"The distance to the beacons can be found in the dataflash log's BCN "
"message's D0, D1, D2, D3 fields."
msgstr "到信标的距离可以在 DataFlash 日志的 BCN 消息的 D0、D1、D2、D3 字段中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:92 2171bc164c554f3baaf3d234263211e6
#: 29b0e9341a454fa694ad18d05a78a9b9 3c85a3f9172d4a84b12784a85703b259
#: 6cacd269deeb442b84b4f9d5bd186a4c 9725597ec5514bbba8770c4432a3a0db
msgid "User videos"
msgstr "用户视频"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:25 03fa42149e59453e9912ba16b51f0b5f
#: 7196b40c281d4188a7ece23d1568f71f d45f7f339bdc45c187bdb0f17cdbddda
#: e349dc2a2b30440496797a10aa2120b1
msgid ""
"The anchors should be placed in a rectangular shape.  The anchor with the "
"lowest ID (IDs are printed in hexadecimal on each device) will act as the "
"\"origin\" and should be placed at the lower-left corner of the rectangle.  "
"Each of the remaining three anchors should be placed in a corner so that the"
" anchor IDs increase as you travel an \"N\" pattern within the rectangle.  "
"The configuration is slightly simpler if the line from the origin anchor to "
"the 2nd anchor is due North but it is not required as the "
":ref:`BCN_ORIENT_YAW <BCN_ORIENT_YAW>` parameter can be used to account this"
" difference."
msgstr ""
"信标（anchor）应布置成矩形。ID 最小的信标（ID "
"以十六进制印在每个设备上）将作为“原点”，应放置在矩形的左下角。其余三个信标应各放置在一个角上，使信标 ID "
"沿矩形内的“N”形路径递增。如果从原点信标到第 2 个信标的连线正对北方，配置会稍微简单一些，但这并非必需，因为可以使用 "
":ref:`BCN_ORIENT_YAW <BCN_ORIENT_YAW>` 参数来补偿这一差异。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:65 4fe49456b5b04c13877a3508f952a381
#: 7cd94cf477cd4953b49fba42c7b78f51 af4e62ff57ea4117a8f957e5928a1c9e
#: b534e896c4e548cc9a4ccb9c6ae2a693
msgid ""
"set :ref:`ARMING_SKIPCHK <ARMING_SKIPCHK>` to 8 to disable the GPS arming "
"check"
msgstr "将 :ref:`ARMING_SKIPCHK <ARMING_SKIPCHK>` 设置为 8 以禁用 GPS 解锁检查"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pozyx.rst:75 13494f89a0dd4f98928922a69f4df02a
#: 3e7c1484e26c4a0489cd72120f4aea3d a8fef273087e4a149e0222119fe4b80f
#: e7c16941278543c88e033658143fb624
msgid ""
"After about 1 minute the vehicle's position should jump to the latitude, "
"longitude you input during the configuration step (above).  If it does not, "
"connect a USB cable to the UNO's USB port and open the Arduino IDE's serial "
"monitor and look for errors."
msgstr ""
"大约 1 分钟后，载具的位置应跳转到你在配置步骤（见上文）中输入的纬度、经度。如果没有，请用 USB 线连接 UNO 的 USB 口，打开 "
"Arduino IDE 的串口监视器查找错误。"
